Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:52.54,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur8}fumitsubuse! fumitsubuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.57,0:21:54.74,ED Romaji,,955,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}shokun, wareware no ninmu wa nani da
